title: "Website Care Checklist"
abstract: "The monthly managed-website care checklist: uptime, backups, SSL and domain-expiry, dependency and accessibility sweeps, security patching, and reporting. Real, runnable checks with scripts, Lighthouse and Pa11y configs, a report template, and a scheduled workflow."
